==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Plus One: Special}}

==Battleground==
*2 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[M. Ost]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**6 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**5 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**4 [[Bore Jr.|Bore Jrs]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Othom]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[M. Ost]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a pretty average Traitless/Relic stage, featuring two M. Osts and three Othoms, with nefarious Traitless enemies like Bore Jr. and Dober P.D to ruin your life. As such, you really want to abuse the wide variety of strong anti-Traitless and Relic Special units present in the game. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] with [[Talents]] is able to chain the M. Ost if you have his Speed talent maxed out, allowing you to shave off huge amounts of his health, and UL Legend Cats like [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Cat Mask Doron]] or [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Storm Beast Naala]] can help a ton for the Othom horde. [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Mystic Uril]] is great here to control the Sir Rels and the second M. Ost, while [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]] is incredibly strong for the Traitless enemies here.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Jagando Jr. (Special Cat)|Jagando Jr.]]: Jagando's strong Surge and damage against Traitless allows him to be a great budget option if you don't have Hitman yet.

